{"strongs": "H5422", "word": "נָתַץ", "translit": "na.tats", "root": "נתב", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "pull down, break down", "definition": "נָתַץ verb pull down, break down (Late Hebrew Hoph`al, and derivatives; compare perhaps Ethiopic (with transposition and weakening of sibilant), destruere, demoliri, excidere Di 634 ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ נ Judg 6:30 +, 3 plural נָָֽתְצוּ 2Kgs 25:10 ; Jer 52:14 , etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִתֹּץ Ezek 26:9 + v Ezek 26:12 ( Co , for ᵑ0 יִתְּצוּ ); וַיִּתֹּץ Judg 9:45 ; 2Kgs 23:7 suffix יִתְּצֵנִי Job 19:10 , יִתָּצְךָ Ps 52:7 1 singular אֶתֹּץ Judg 8:9 3 masculine plural וַיִּתְּצוּ 2Kgs 10:27 (twice in verse); 2 masculine plural תִּתֹּ֑צוּ Deut 7:5 , תִּתֹּצ֑וּן Exod 34:13 ; Judg 2:2 וַתִּתְֿצוּ Isa 22:2 , etc.; Imperative נְתֹץ Ps 58:7 Infinitive construct לִנְתֿוֺץ Jer 1:10 ; Jer 18:7 , לִנְתֹֿץ Jer 31:28 (on תֿ see Ges «GKC:45g»§ 45g ); Passive participle plural הַנְּתֻצִים Jer 33:4 — 1. literally pull down a structure (accusative): altar Judg 2:2 ; Judg 6:30 ; Judg 6:31 ; Judg 6:32 ; Exod 34:13 ( J ), Deut 7:5 ; 2Kgs 23:12 high place ( במה ) v 2Kgs 23:8 , בָּמָה + מִזְבֵּחַ v 2Kgs 23:15 מַצֵּבָה 2Kgs 10:27 בֵּית הַבַּעַל v 2Kgs 10:27 ; 2Kgs 11:18 = 2Chr 23:17 , compare 2Kgs 23:7 a tower Judg 8:9 ; Judg 8:17 , compare Ezek 26:9 ( בְּחַרְבוֺתָיו ); (any) house Isa 22:10 ; Ezek 26:12 ; Lev 14:45 , so הַנְּחֻצִים Jer 33:4 (strangely + אֶל , compare Gf Gie ); city-wall Jer 39:8 ; 2Kgs 25:10 = Jer 52:14 city Judg 9:45 . 2. figurative: \\ \\ a. pull down a nation, break its power, וּלְהַאֲבִיד ׳ וְלִנְתוֺשׁ וְלִנ ( וְלַהֲרוֺס ) (object not expressed) Jer 1:10 (so ), = Jer 18:7 , compare Jer 31:18 . \\ \\ b. an individual, subject God, יִתְּצֵנִי סָבִיב Job 19:10 , יִתָּצְךָ Ps 52:7 . \\ \\ c. jaw-teeth of lions (metaphor) Ps 58:7 ( break down, break off , so only here, but see נָתַע ). Niph`al be pulled, broken, down: Perfect 3 plural ׳ נִתְּצוּ מִפְּנֵי י Jer 4:26 (of cities), so מִמֶּנּוּ ׳ נ Nah 1:6 (of rocks). Pi`el Perfect 3 masculine singular נִתַּץ 2Chr 33:3 3 plural וְנִתְּצוּ Ezek 16:39 (consecutive); 2 masculine plural וְנִתַּצְתֶּם Deut 12:3 Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיְנַתֵּץ 2Chr 34:7 3 masculine plural וַיְנַתְּצוּ 2Chr 31:1 + 2 t.; — tear down (chiefly late): with accusative altars Deut 12:3 , + בָּמוֺת 2Chr 31:1 , + הַחַמָּנִים , etc., 2Chr 34:4 , + אֲשֵׁרִים v 2Chr 34:7 בָּמוֺת alone 2Chr 33:3 , רָמֹתַיִךְ Ezek 16:39 city wall 2Chr 36:19 . Pu`al be torn down: Perfect 3 masculine singular נֻתַּץ Judg 6:28 (of altar + אֲשֵׁרָה ). Hoph`al (or Qal passive Ges «GKC:53u»§ 53u ) be broken down, broken , only Imperfect 3 masculine singular ייֻתָּ֑ץ Lev 11:35 (of תַּנּוּר , see Dr-Wh Hpt , and כִּירַיִם , see above).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5458')\">BDB5458</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5422')\">H5422</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5457')\">BDB5457</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5459')\">BDB5459</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נָתַץ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>pull down, break down</highlightword> (Late Hebrew Hoph`al, and derivatives; compare perhaps Ethiopic <placeholder3493/> (with transposition and weakening of sibilant), <highlight>destruere, demoliri, excidere</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup>634</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,30)\">Judg 6:30</ref> +, 3 plural <bdbheb>נָָֽתְצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,10)\">2Kgs 25:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 52:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,14)\">Jer 52:14</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִתֹּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,9)\">Ezek 26:9</ref> + v<ref ref=\"Ezek 26:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,12)\">Ezek 26:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>, for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>יִתְּצוּ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>וַיִּתֹּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:45\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,45)\">Judg 9:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,7)\">2Kgs 23:7</ref> suffix <bdbheb>יִתְּצֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 19:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,10)\">Job 19:10</ref>, <bdbheb>יִתָּצְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 52:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,7)\">Ps 52:7</ref> 1 singular <bdbheb>אֶתֹּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,9)\">Judg 8:9</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיִּתְּצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,27)\">2Kgs 10:27</ref> (twice in verse); 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תִּתֹּ֑צוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,5)\">Deut 7:5</ref>, <bdbheb>תִּתֹּצ֑וּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 34:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,13)\">Exod 34:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 2:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,2)\">Judg 2:2</ref> <bdbheb>וַתִּתְֿצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,2)\">Isa 22:2</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>נְתֹץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 58:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,7)\">Ps 58:7</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לִנְתֿוֺץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 1:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,10)\">Jer 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 18:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,7)\">Jer 18:7</ref>, <bdbheb>לִנְתֹֿץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 31:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,28)\">Jer 31:28</ref> (on <bdbheb>תֿ</bdbheb> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:45g»§ 45g</sup>); <highlight>Passive participle</highlight> plural <bdbheb>הַנְּתֻצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,4)\">Jer 33:4</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> literally <highlight>pull down</highlight> a structure (accusative): altar <ref ref=\"Judg 2:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,2)\">Judg 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,30)\">Judg 6:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:31\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,31)\">Judg 6:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:32\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,32)\">Judg 6:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 34:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,13)\">Exod 34:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 7:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,5)\">Deut 7:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,12)\">2Kgs 23:12</ref> high place (<bdbheb>במה</bdbheb>) v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,8)\">2Kgs 23:8</ref>, <bdbheb>בָּמָה</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>מִזְבֵּחַ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,15)\">2Kgs 23:15</ref> <bdbheb>מַצֵּבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,27)\">2Kgs 10:27</ref> <bdbheb>בֵּית הַבַּעַל</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,27)\">2Kgs 10:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,18)\">2Kgs 11:18</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,17)\">2Chr 23:17</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,7)\">2Kgs 23:7</ref> a tower <ref ref=\"Judg 8:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,9)\">Judg 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,17)\">Judg 8:17</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,9)\">Ezek 26:9</ref> (<bdbheb>בְּחַרְבוֺתָיו</bdbheb>); (any) house <ref ref=\"Isa 22:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,10)\">Isa 22:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,12)\">Ezek 26:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:45\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,45)\">Lev 14:45</ref>, so <bdbheb>הַנְּחֻצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,4)\">Jer 33:4</ref> (strangely + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup>); city-wall <ref ref=\"Jer 39:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,8)\">Jer 39:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,10)\">2Kgs 25:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,14)\">Jer 52:14</ref> city <ref ref=\"Judg 9:45\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,45)\">Judg 9:45</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>pull down</highlight> a nation, break its power, <bdbheb>וּלְהַאֲבִיד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְלִנְתוֺשׁ וְלִנ</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>וְלַהֲרוֺס</bdbheb>) (object not expressed) <ref ref=\"Jer 1:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,10)\">Jer 1:10</ref> (so <wrongReferenceRemoved/>), = <ref ref=\"Jer 18:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,7)\">Jer 18:7</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Jer 31:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,18)\">Jer 31:18</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> an individual, subject God, <bdbheb>יִתְּצֵנִי סָבִיב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 19:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,10)\">Job 19:10</ref>, <bdbheb>יִתָּצְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 52:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,7)\">Ps 52:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> jaw-teeth of lions (metaphor) <ref ref=\"Ps 58:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,7)\">Ps 58:7</ref> (<highlight>break down, break off</highlight>, so only here, but see  <bdbheb><reflink>נָתַע</reflink></bdbheb>). <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>be pulled, broken, down: Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִתְּצוּ מִפְּנֵי י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 4:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,26)\">Jer 4:26</ref> (of cities), so <bdbheb>מִמֶּנּוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 1:6\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,6)\">Nah 1:6</ref> (of rocks). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>נִתַּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,3)\">2Chr 33:3</ref> 3 plural <bdbheb>וְנִתְּצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:39\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,39)\">Ezek 16:39</ref> (consecutive); 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>וְנִתַּצְתֶּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 12:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,3)\">Deut 12:3</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיְנַתֵּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,7)\">2Chr 34:7</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיְנַתְּצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,1)\">2Chr 31:1</ref> + 2 t.; — <highlight>tear down</highlight> (chiefly late): with accusative altars <ref ref=\"Deut 12:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,3)\">Deut 12:3</ref>, + <bdbheb>בָּמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,1)\">2Chr 31:1</ref>, + <bdbheb>הַחַמָּנִים</bdbheb>, etc., <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,4)\">2Chr 34:4</ref>, + <bdbheb>אֲשֵׁרִים</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Chr 34:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,7)\">2Chr 34:7</ref> <bdbheb>בָּמוֺת</bdbheb> alone <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,3)\">2Chr 33:3</ref>, <bdbheb>רָמֹתַיִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:39\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,39)\">Ezek 16:39</ref> city wall <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,19)\">2Chr 36:19</ref>. <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>be torn down: Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>נֻתַּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,28)\">Judg 6:28</ref> (of altar + <bdbheb>אֲשֵׁרָה</bdbheb>). <b>Hoph`al</b> (or <b>Qal</b> <highlight>passive</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:53u»§ 53u</sup>) <highlight>be broken down, broken</highlight>, only <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>ייֻתָּ֑ץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 11:35\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(3,11,35)\">Lev 11:35</ref> (of <bdbheb>תַּנּוּר</bdbheb>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr-Wh')\">Dr-Wh<sup>Hpt</sup></lookup>, and <bdbheb>כִּירַיִם</bdbheb>, see above). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Judg 6:30", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "2Kgs 25:10", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 25, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Jer 52:14", "book": "JER", "chapter": 52, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ezek 26:9", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 26, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 26:12", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 26, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Judg 9:45", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 45}, {"raw": "2Kgs 23:7", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 23, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Job 19:10", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 19, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ps 52:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 52, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Judg 8:9", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 8, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "2Kgs 10:27", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 10, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Deut 7:5", "bo